        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2512.00007">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2512.00007">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2512.00007">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
